@imotov what if we did not require `index.time_series.start_time` and `index.time_series.end_time` at all and use their default values when missing?

This would allow users to create a single TSDB index without explicitly setting those parameters (see example below). Would this cause any problems when a TSDB index is created in a data stream?
 
